  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the latus rectum of an ellipse is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;units and the distance between a focus and its nearest vertex on the major axis is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units, then its eccentricity is",
